@startuml timeline-extended-validity-state
title Validity status of one entry (computed at read time)
[*] --> SUPERSEDED : a newer entry exists in its group
note top of SUPERSEDED
  groups: RCA, CASCO, ROVINIETA, ITP,
  EXTINGUISHER, FIRST_AID
end note
[*] --> UNKNOWN : current, ITP without validUntil
[*] --> VALID : current, validUntil - today > 30d
VALID --> EXPIRING : validUntil - today <= 30d
EXPIRING --> EXPIRED : today > validUntil
VALID --> SUPERSEDED : newer entry added
EXPIRING --> SUPERSEDED : newer entry added
EXPIRED --> SUPERSEDED : newer entry added
UNKNOWN --> SUPERSEDED : newer entry added
SUPERSEDED --> VALID : newer entry deleted
@enduml
